153	// A later CLEAN run of the same task is that answer, in the queue's own record. The
154	// item converges `rejected` naming the run, and the person never reads it.
155	//
156	// STRICTLY later, and only against the item's own last touch: an equal-or-earlier
157	// success says nothing about a failure that came after it. Only parked items — a
158	// live one is the machinery working — and only the kinds that named something
159	// broken (`SUPERSEDABLE_PARKS`).
