201	// lookup. An item carries its task twice — the id in its title and the worker PATH in
202	// its body — and only the id is canonicalized across a pack rename
203	// (`parseWorkItemTitle`). So an item open across one keeps naming the pre-rename
204	// directory, the executor's path guard refuses it (executor.mjs), and it parks
