135	// The same reading under the name it has inside a code-work subprocess, which the
136	// runner starts with the TASK directory as its cwd. A second name rather than a
137	// second reader: the two callers mean different trees, and `repoRoot()` in the one
138	// that means a task directory reads as a bug wherever it is quoted.
